WEBVTT

00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:31.126
It's closing down barriers,

00:10:31.168 --> 00:10:34.088
geographic barriers, social barriers,

00:10:34.088 --> 00:10:35.255
economic barriers.

00:10:35.297 --> 00:10:37.633
It enabled Rudy to go and live his dream.

00:10:37.675 --> 00:10:39.134
We all have dreams

00:10:39.176 --> 00:10:42.096
and this is allowing us
to go and fulfill our dreams.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:46.892
A new generation of people
is starting to understand

00:10:46.934 --> 00:10:50.813
what it really means to go and live
in a world augmented by technology.

00:10:51.355 --> 00:10:54.191
The relevance of it, the context of it,

00:10:54.233 --> 00:10:56.819
what it actually means to go
and connect with people

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.987
and technology being part of everything.

00:10:59.029 --> 00:11:02.282
They are able to go and reimagine
the world around them.